(see the sibling detector.yml).

Honors the SNIFF_EXTRA_IGNORE env var: a comma-separated list of glob
patterns, matched against each file's path relative to PATH, that should be
skipped. sniff sets this once per run from the consuming repo's .sniff.toml
`[ignore] globs`, the same contract every external detector must honor.

